      "writtenOn": "2018-01-04T13:39:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This could get really expensive. On a device with 100 apps and both cell and wifi, we\u0027re going to be logging 100-200 lines every 2MB of data transferred. Can we change it to a level that\u0027s not visible by default? (ALOGD or ALOGV, not sure which.)\n\nEventually we\u0027d want to be able to list only those lines where qtaguid differ by a minimum percentage and a minimum byte/packet count, but that\u0027s probably more work than we can do in this patch series.\n\nAlso, long line.",
